   "textKind": "adaptation",
   "layer": "present"
  },
  "id": "C12-007",
  "speaker": "feng",
  "text": "凤姐又悄悄的道：“大天白日，人来人往，你就在这里也不方便。你且去，等着晚上起了更你来，悄悄的在西边穿堂儿等我。”",
  "title": "约在西边穿堂",
  "actions": [
   {
    "type": "effect",
    "actor": "feng",
    "kind": "idle",
    "duration": 1.8
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "chapter": "c12-visit",
  "scene": "c6_wangchui",
  "place": "凤姐院 · 房内",
  "focus": "feng_room",
  "source": {
