  "source": {
   "chapter": 12,
   "paragraphLead": "那贾瑞只盼不到晚上",
   "textKind": "adaptation",
   "layer": "present"
  },
  "id": "C12-034",
  "speaker": "jia_qiang",
  "text": "贾蔷一把揪住道：“别走！如今琏二嫂已经告到太太跟前，说你无故调戏他。他暂用了个脱身计，哄你在这边等着，太太气死过去，因此叫我来拿你。”",
  "title": "琏二嫂告到太太跟前",
  "actions": [
   {
    "type": "effect",
    "actor": "jia_qiang",
    "kind": "anger",
    "duration": 1.8
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "chapter": "c12-extort",
  "scene": "c12_passage",
  "place": "荣府 · 房后空屋",
  "focus": "corner",
  "source": {
   "chapter": 12,
   "paragraphLead": "贾瑞听了，魂不附体",
   "textKind": "adaptation",
   "layer": "present"
  },
  "id": "C12-040",
  "speaker": "jia_rui",
  "text": "贾瑞听了，魂不附体，只说：“好侄儿，只说没有见我，明日我重重的谢你。”",
  "title": "明日重重的谢你",
  "actions": [
   {
    "type": "effect",
    "actor": "jia_rui",
    "kind": "anger",
    "duration": 1.8
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "chapter": "c12-extort",
  "scene": "c12_passage",
  "place": "荣府 · 房后空屋",
  "focus": "corner",
  "source": {
   "chapter": 12,
   "paragraphLead": "贾瑞听了，魂不附体",
   "textKind": "adaptation",
   "layer": "present"
  },
  "id": "C12-041",
  "speaker": "jia_qiang",
  "text": "贾蔷道：“你若谢我，放你不值什么，只不知你谢我多少？况且口说无凭，写一文契来。”贾瑞道：“这如何落纸呢？”贾蔷道：“写一个赌钱输了外人帐目，借头家银若干两便罢。”",
  "title": "写一文契来",
  "actions": [
   {
    "type": "effect",
    "actor": "jia_qiang",
    "kind": "idle",
    "duration": 1.8
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "chapter": "c12-extort",
  "scene": "c12_passage",
  "place": "荣府 · 房后空屋",
  "focus": "corner",
  "source": {
   "chapter": 12,
   "paragraphLead": "贾瑞听了，魂不附体",
   "textKind": "adaptation",
   "layer": "present"
