  "scene": "c12_passage",
  "place": "荣府 · 房后空屋",
  "focus": "corner",
  "source": {
   "chapter": 12,
   "paragraphLead": "贾瑞听了，魂不附体",
   "textKind": "adaptation",
   "layer": "present"
  },
  "id": "C12-043",
  "speaker": "jia_qiang",
  "text": "贾蔷又道：“如今要放你，我就担着不是。老太太那边的门早已关了，如今只好走后门。这屋你还藏不得，少时就来堆东西。”",
  "title": "这屋还藏不得",
  "actions": [
   {
    "type": "effect",
    "actor": "jia_qiang",
    "kind": "idle",
    "duration": 1.8
   }
  ]
 },
